 e.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jjCCZcCtggGjKik2gXjyux1VEdZ.jpg" width="220" alt="Affi
 che de Spider-Man : Brand New Day (VF)"><br><small>(Spider-Man: Brand New 
 Day)   (1407.5)</small><br><small>2h30</small></td><td width="16"></td><td
  valign="top"><i>Science-Fiction\, Action\, Aventure</i><br>United States 
