 a Morreale\n- Randy Moore\n- Gabriela Gunčíková\n\n\n(synopsis non enco
 re traduit sur TMDB)\nCaptured live over the course of GHOST’s two sold-
 out shows in Mexico City last year\, 2 BIG TO RIG is the definitive docume
 nt of the band's unforgettable SKELETOUR WORLD TOUR\, presented in IMAX® 
